# ─── Student data — never commit, never push ──────────────────────────────
# De-identified COMP2017 coursework held under the CARE ethics protocol.
# Storage and access are specified in methodology §6; a push to any remote
# would put it outside the approved arrangement.
data/
review1/

# ─── Third-party dataset (re-downloadable) ────────────────────────────────
# Oliveira, Keuning & Jeuring (2025) Zenodo release — companion to
# https://doi.org/10.1145/3769994.3770000
Dataset_2025_Koli_Paper/

# ─── Machine-local settings ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json
.vscode/
.env
.venv/
venv/

# ─── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─── Model and run outputs (large, regenerable) ───────────────────────────
runs/
checkpoints/
outputs/
wandb/
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt

# ─── Office lock files (docs/ is tracked, so these would otherwise show up) ─
~$*

# ─── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Quarantine for files git could not unlink (see note in CLAUDE.md); safe to delete
_to_delete/
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# ─── Literature PDFs — 143 MB of published papers, not ours to redistribute ──
# The index at docs/literature/README.md IS tracked: it carries title, year and a
# DOI/arXiv/ACL link for every file, which is what anyone cloning the repo needs.
# Rebuild the folder from those links, or copy it across by hand.
docs/literature/*.pdf

# ─── Backups made before an in-place edit ────────────────────────────────────
# *.fontbak is the pre-strip copy of a .docx (docs/generators/strip_embedded_fonts.py);
# methodology.docx.fontbak alone is 21 MB. Safe to delete once the edited file opens.
*.bak
# dated backups written before an in-place edit, e.g. tally_coding.py.bak-20260919.
# `*.bak` alone does not match these, and they were turning up in the commit list.
*.bak-*
*.fontbak
*.tmp

# ─── Not pushed (DW, 21 Oct 2026, D-145) ─────────────────────────────────────
# The thesis, the document archive and office/PDF outputs under docs/ stay local.
# Markdown sources, the decision register, handoff, codebook guides and code stay tracked.
docs/thesis/
docs/archive/
docs/**/*.docx
docs/**/*.pdf
_backup/

# Untracked from 28 Oct 2026 (D-203): tmp/ holds local generation entries and previews
# (CLAUDE.md, where files go, rule 4); .codex/ is machine-local.
tmp/
.codex/

# ─── Training caches and logs (5 Nov 2026) ──────────────────────────────────────
# The trainer keeps the downloaded model (about 6 GB) in .cache/.
.cache/
*.log
